### Account Creation Workflow
# Requires a running server (npm run dev:server)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/

### STEP 1: Login as SUPERADMIN (required since this provides the access token for subsequent requests)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### STEP 2: Register a BUSINESS entity (SUPERADMIN only)
# @name businessEntity
POST {{baseUrl}}registration/business-entity
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "BuyBuyin HQ",
    "location": "Manila"
}

### STEP 3: Register a SUBSCRIBER account (HQ ADMIN)
# @name subscriberAccount
POST {{baseUrl}}registration/subscriber-account
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "johnsjbinas@gmail.com",
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Benedict"
}
